{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484669,"name":"Aviv Yeshayav","username":"TheAviv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/theaviv/{size}/119258_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T17:01:09.947Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct:\u003c/strong\u003e Grok Bot (computerUse / box desktop)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccount:\u003c/strong\u003e aviv@theaviv.ca\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDate:\u003c/strong\u003e 2026-09-06\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSummary\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen attaching a local ~136MB MP4 via the native GTK “Open Files” dialog, clicking Open often does nothing: computer_use returns success, the dialog stays open, and the browser never receives the file. Drag-and-drop from the file manager also failed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ecomputerUse opens Chrome to Facebook / TikTok / LinkedIn / Threads composer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTrigger native file picker\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSelect \u003ccode\u003e/home/box/Downloads/Quest_for_the_Truth_suno_square.mp4\u003c/code\u003e (selection works)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Open (or Enter / Alt+O)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen dismisses chooser and hands file to the page input.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLinux\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot available in this report; issue observed on Grok Bot computerUse / box desktop.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eActual\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nDialog remains; file not attached. Tool result often shows success with no error. Some agents report “failed safety classification” with no quoted Auto-review error text.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSame session: YouTube Studio + Instagram eventually accepted the same file after many Open retries. Facebook, TikTok, LinkedIn, Threads never attached. In-app SendFeedback already filed; emailing \u003ca href=\"mailto:hi@cursor.com\"\u003ehi@cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e with screenshot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484669-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484669-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSometimes - I can sometimes use Cursor\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T17:24:00.236Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170816,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-computeruse-gtk-file-chooser-open-no-ops-for-local-video-upload","display_username":"Aviv Yeshayav","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135276,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-computeruse-gtk-file-chooser-open-no-ops-for-local-video-upload/170816/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":484676,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T17:23:27.384Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. This is a known issue with the native Open Files dialog on the Bot computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s happening: the Bot desktop has a fixed screen with a dock along the bottom edge, and the Open/Cancel buttons in the dialog often end up right on top of that dock. Your click goes to the dock instead of the button, so the dialog stays open. The file itself is fine, which is why the same MP4 eventually uploaded to YouTube Studio and Instagram when the dialog happened to be positioned higher.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo ways to unblock yourself right now:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsk the Bot to attach the file without using the Open dialog at all. For example: “Use your browser tool to set the page’s file input directly with the DevTools command \u003ccode\u003eDOM.setFileInputFiles\u003c/code\u003e, pointing at \u003ccode\u003e/home/box/Downloads/Quest_for_the_Truth_suno_square.mp4\u003c/code\u003e. Do not use the Open Files dialog.” This fully bypasses the dialog.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf the site still requires the dialog, ask the Bot to drag the dialog up by its title bar (or double click the title bar to maximize it) so the Open button is above the dock, then click Open.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo confirm this on your box, please send:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA screenshot of the Bot screen at the moment it clicks Open (is the Open button sitting right on top of the dock icons at the bottom, or a bit above).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Request ID from that conversation right click the Bot message \u0026gt; Copy request ID.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re tracking the dialog geometry issue and the no dialog upload path. I’ll reply here when there’s an update.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T17:23:27.384Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170816,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-computeruse-gtk-file-chooser-open-no-ops-for-local-video-upload","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-computeruse-gtk-file-chooser-open-no-ops-for-local-video-upload/170816/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":484741,"name":"Aviv Yeshayav","username":"TheAviv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/theaviv/{size}/119258_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T22:54:17.715Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eUpdate — human Open also no-ops\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurther evidence (2026-09-06 evening): I took over the Grok Bot computer myself. GTK Open File dialog was open on TikTok Studio upload with Quest_for_the_Truth_suno_square.mp4 selected under /home/box/Downloads/. Clicking Open as a human does nothing — the dialog stays open and the file is not handed to Chrome.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo this is not only computerUse / Auto-review. The native GTK Open button on the box appears broken for humans too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso escalated by email to \u003ca href=\"mailto:hi@cursor.com\"\u003ehi@cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e (same thread as the original report) with a screenshot.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T22:54:17.715Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":0.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170816,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-computeruse-gtk-file-chooser-open-no-ops-for-local-video-upload","display_username":"Aviv Yeshayav","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":fals